      "geez_phonetic": "kahn nfḳ: wetewekef nsḥane wetḥtnane wegnayatīne ḳdme tabotke ḳdst semayawīt weḳdme mswa'īke ḳdus semayawī ze'inbele newr weze'inbele denes.",
