      "reference": "Intro to the Prayer of the Covenant. The Trisagion Prayer. The cry of those who weep for the dead.",
      "chapter": "Kidan",
      "stanza": "Intro",
      "english": "፨ People: sits at the right hand of the Father and will come again in glory to judge the living and the dead; have mercy upon us, Lord.",
