      "chapter": "Kidan",
      "stanza": "Part2",
      "english": "Priest: You have loosed us, we who believe in You, and covered us with faith.",
      "geez_script": "ካህን፤ ዘእማዕሠር ለእለ የአምኑብከ ፈቲሐከ በሃይማኖት ከለልከነ፣",
