      "chapter": "3",
      "stanza": "150",
      "english": "፨ People: Holy, holy, holy are You, Father Almighty, Holy, holy, holy are You, Only-Begotten Who are the Word of the living Father. Holy, holy, holy are You, Holy Spirit Who knows all things.",
