      "reference": "Prayer of Benediction of St. Basil from Anaphora of the Apostles",
      "chapter": "Apostles",
      "stanza": "10",
      "english": "Asst. Priest: O! Holy Trinity, Father and Son and Holy Spirit, bless your people, Christians beloved, with blessings heavenly and earthly:",
