      "geez_phonetic": "kahn nfḳ: 'o 'igzī'iye  'īyesus krstos ḥawts ḥmu mane ḥzbeke fewsomu wemrḥomu le'abewīne wele'ahawīne 'ile ḥoru wete'angedu.",
