      "amharic_phonetic": "፨ ḥzb: 'asdenaḳī bemīhon yeṭbebu haylna be'asgeramī blhatu beḳdst béte krstīyanu mekakel yekrstos 'akalat yhonu zend beḳtsbet ylewṭachewal.",
