      "english": "People: Ye who have conquered the world by patience, pray for us day and night standing in front of our Creator, so that death will not take us before we have repented.",
      "geez_script": "፨ ሕዝብ፤ መዋዕያነ ዓለም አንትሙ በብዙኀ ትዕግሥት፣ ሰአሉ ቅድመ ፈጣሪ በኵሉ ሰዓት፤ እንበለ ንስሐ ኪያነ ኢይንሥአ ሞት።",
