      "english": "Clergy: O the only-begotten Son and lover of man, fill my mouth with Your praise that I may praise Your glory,",
      "geez_script": "ካህናት፤ ኦ ወልድ ዋሕድ ወመፍ ቀሬ ሰብእ ምላዕ አፉየ ስብሐቲከ ከመ እሰብሕ አኰቴተከ",
      "geez_phonetic": "kahnat: 'o weld waḥd wemef ḳeré seb'i mla'i 'afuye sbḥatīke keme 'isebḥ 'akwetéteke",
