      "reference": "",
      "chapter": "St.Mary",
      "stanza": "26",
      "english": "Priest: Holy is God the Father who loved you, holy is the only-begotten Son who abode in your womb, and holy is the Paraclete, the Spirit of righteousness, who strengthened you.",
