      "reference": "Theotokia",
      "chapter": "St.Mary",
      "stanza": "29",
      "english": "Priest: The shuttle is the Word himself, Jesus Christ. The length of the wrap is the shadow of God the Most High. The weaver is the Holy Spirit.",
