      "amharic_phonetic": "kahn: : yep̣ap̣asatun 'aleḳoch p̣ap̣asatu nna 'ép̣īs ḳop̣osatun, ḳesa wstunna dīyaḳonatun, 'anbabīwochnna mezemra nun, denaglunna mene kwesatun, baltétochunna 'abat 'inat yemotubache wn,",
      "tigrinya_script": "",
