      "english": "Priest (to the Asst. Priests): The power of our father Peter.\nAsst. Priests: May God appoint you in His everlasting kingdom.",
      "geez_script": "ካህን፤ ሢመተ እዴሁ ለአቡነ ጴጥሮስ\nካህን ንፍቅ፤ እግዚአብሔር ይሢምከ ውስተ ዘለዓለም መንግሥቱ",
      "geez_phonetic": "kahn: sīmete 'idéhu le'abune p̣éṭros\nkahn nfḳ: 'igzī'abḥér ysīmke wste zele'alem mengstu",
